{
  "comment": "TinyCat 4.5.6 table -> Spire Ledger metric alignment. Every TinyCat table must resolve to exactly one entry. Entries with ledger_metric=null are not compared and carry their own classification (a/b need a ref; c means unregistered and fails). Alias tables are game-ID facts that TinyCat applies before counting (CardNameNormalizer, EncounterStats.getNameReplacementMap).",
